          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ato igh pipö Israel löwïr ngokï kïpeny kirurut pö ECHOTYON amelö ompö kwötyin, kï kinam ngokï, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nyini kösöwï chane ngokikwa cho kegh, kïmïchini kïkötï ngaryan Ema nyo mi ECHOTYON le ropöwonto ngokï. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akukana poyikwa ewunekwa mötïto ngaryan akepara atoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kïcheng Tïsin nyo Wow kisönkö walaka akwip kïlït Ema nyo mi ECHOTYON. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akulut morïn kisönchay akwisö kïnyïl mut nko odeny ananka nyo kikingotyeghö Wölo Tïlil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kutö kisönkö walaka kuyo ato kïpelo tïkwïn cho ngutoy cho onyïn ompö Ema nyo mi ECHOTYON. Atolapay kïcheng kisönkö chinö köngötï akïmïlchï kelyo ato kïpelo amöros ompö kuka Emanay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chengöy nyinte sunetkö löwïr akïpel ompö ato kïpelo amöros ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akwigh ngaryantanoni le wölay kida ngaryanta ropöwonto ngokï, kulinyö nyu tïsin chane nko ECHOTYON, atökelöstoghchï. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sïtöy nyinte ngaryantanay sanypa kanasyan akïpel le atay kipel ngaryante nyo tagh. Nyete kï ropöwonto ngokï.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ato igh kintoghintö ngokï kïpeny kirurut pö ECHOTYON amelö ompö kwötyin, kï kinam ngokï, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nyini kösöwï nyinte ngokichi, kïmïchini kurewï kwagha nyo lïpop le ropöwontenyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akukana ewunyi mötïto kwagha akïpörchï atay kïpörchini amöros nyo kïpelöy ompö ECHOTYON. Nyete kï ropöwon nyo chengöy ngokï. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kulut tïsin morïn kisön pö kwaghayay, akutö kuyo ato kïpelo amöros. Atolapay kïcheng kisönkö chinö kïngötï akïmïlchï kelyo ato kïpelo amöros. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kïpel tïsin sunetkö löwïr ompö ato kïpelo amöros le wölo idoy sunet pö ropöwo tuyo pöghisyö. Ighöy tïsin lenyoni ompö ngoki kintöghoghin atökïlinyö nko ECHOTYON atökelöstoghchï.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
